  status_note: "test ship, values from the current client may change before release"
abilities:
  - kind: combat_instructions
    name: Immediate Main Battery Fire Adjustment
    activation: Press the Combat Instructions key (F by default) once the meter is full.
    charge:
      - "Reinforce an allied ship with a consumable: +50% (Gun Crew Assistance, Engineering Crew Assistance, Auxiliary and Torpedo Armament Assistance)"
      - "Reinforce your ship with a consumable: +25% (Gun Crew Assistance, Engineering Crew Assistance, Auxiliary and Torpedo Armament Assistance)"
    duration_s: 50
    effects:
      - +20% Main battery AP shell damage
      - "-20% Maximum main battery shell dispersion"
    uses_per_battle: "At most 4 per battle without captain skills or upgrades: only consumable uses fill the meter, and the ship carries up to 8 charges of them (Gun Crew Assistance 3; Auxiliary and Torpedo Armament Assistance 3, if taken over Spotting Aircraft or Fighters; Engineering Crew Assistance 2). 4 uses with every listed consumable taken and every charge earning the largest gain listed under charge; 1 when every charge earns the smallest gain and each slot with a choice holds another option. No cooldown: each use empties the meter, which must fill to 100% again before the next use."
